### Data Quality & Sourcing Notes

<div style="border-left:4px solid #1E3A8A;background:#EFF6FF;padding:8px 12px;margin:8px 0;border-radius:4px;">
<strong>Source-access limitation, not data absence:</strong> The two primary statutory sources (the FY22-23 Annual Report and the 31-Mar-2023 IRDAI NL public-disclosure PDF) are scanned/image-based filings. OCR extraction returned heavily degraded tables — numeric cells stripped of their row labels in the <em>Analytical Ratios</em> and <em>Balance Sheet</em> schedules in particular. Three separate full-document read attempts were made with no further improvement; per instructions, unresolved cells are left blank rather than estimated.
